# README Adoption SoT

**Role:** first-run adoption (quick start, essential flags, short config/API, docs hub). **Not:** flag encyclopedia or pipeline internals. Exit-code SoT → cli-reference.

Ownership: [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md). Lint: `lintReadmeDoc`.

## Forbidden

- `## Advanced` / marketing `## Features` dumps; encyclopedia headings (pipeline detail, full flag laundry)
- `\bM\d+\b`, changelog voice

## Allowed

- Quick start, ~8 essential flags, short config/API, short exit overview linking cli-reference, docs hub

## Sync

Essential flag → README **and** cli-reference. Power-user/internals → cli-reference only; workflows → recipes.
